WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-03 - The Boy Inside
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2000: Guiding Stars

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.400
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:25.711 --> 00:00:30.200
They saw a chair, they saw a screen

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.553
A quiet boy, a silent scene

00:00:37.615 --> 00:00:41.500
They didn't see the brilliant light

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:47.043
That burned inside, so pure and bright

00:00:49.786 --> 00:00:53.500
They didn't hear your wicked wit

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.800
