00:01:04.919 --> 00:01:08.000
'Cause I don't see the boy they see

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.000
I only see the best of me

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:14.247
Reflected in your knowing eyes

00:01:14.327 --> 00:01:17.500
Beneath the clear and open skies

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.200
I'll be your voice, I'll be your shield

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.433
A fortress that will never yield

00:01:22.533 --> 00:01:26.800
They'll never know, they'll never find

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:33.562
The brilliant, beautiful boy inside

00:01:37.101 --> 00:01:40.200
And when I'm with you in the night

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.800
Beneath the soft and fading light

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:46.688
They see a line they think we've crossed

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:52.500
A treasure gained, a virtue lost

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:55.800
But they don't know this sacred space

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:01.059
This perfect time, this perfect place

00:02:01.459 --> 00:02:04.800
